EMERALD TABLETS OF THOTH

full Forward Codex

i
I, Thoth the Atlantean, pass these keys of ancient wisdom from the lost civilization of Atlantis into the Halls of Amenti for those who seek the Light in the final cycles.

Tablet 1
I, Thoth, the Atlantean, master of mysteries, keeper of records, mighty king, magician, living from generation to generation, being about to pass into the Halls of Amenti, set down for the guidance of those that are to come after, these records of the mighty wisdom of Great Atlantis. In the great city of Keor on the island of Undal, in a time far past, I began this incarnation. Not as the little men of the present age did the mighty ones of Atlantis live and die.

Tablet 2
The Halls of Amenti. Deep in the Earth’s heart lie the Halls of Amenti. Far beneath the islands of sunken Atlantis, Halls of the Dead and halls of the living, bathed in the fire of the infinite ALL. Far in a past time, lost in the mists of the ages, I, Thoth, opened the doorway.

Tablet 3
The Key of Wisdom. I, Thoth, the Atlantean, give of my wisdom, give of my knowledge, give of my power. Formless am I, yet forming all. I come from beyond time, from the space where time has no meaning. I come from the infinite Light of the Great Central Sun. Listen ye, O man, and be wise.

Tablet 4
The Space Born. Long, long ago in the days of the first man, before the flood, in the days of the first man, did the Great Ones come down from the stars, from the worlds beyond the stars. They came in ships of fire and light.

Tablet 5
The Dweller of Unal. In the Halls of Amenti, deep in the silence, sits the Dweller of Unal, Lord of the Lords of Amenti. He is the guardian of the gateway, the keeper of the threshold between life and death. He holds the keys and the power of the ancient ones.

Tablet 6
The Key of Magic. I, Thoth, the Atlantean, master of mysteries, keeper of records, mighty king, magician, living from generation to generation, give of my knowledge, give of my power. Hear ye now the wisdom of magic, the knowledge of the ancient ones.

Tablet 7
The Seven Lords. Deep in the Halls of Amenti sit the Seven Lords of the Cycles. They are the guardians of the cycles, the keepers of the keys of time. They control the destiny of man and the fate of the worlds. They are the Lords of the inner worlds and the outer worlds.

Tablet 8
The Key of Mysteries. Unto thee, O man, have I given my knowledge. Unto thee have I given of Light. Listen ye now to the voice of wisdom. Listen ye now to the voice of Thoth. I am the bringer of the Light.

Tablet 9
The Key of Freedom of Space. List ye, O man, hear ye my voice, teaching of Wisdom and Light in this cycle; teach ye the way to the Light. List ye now to the voice of Thoth. I am the bringer of the Light.

Tablet 10
The Key of Time. List ye, O man, hear ye my voice, teaching of Wisdom and Light in this cycle; teach ye the way to the Light. List ye now to the voice of Thoth. I am the bringer of the Light.

Tablet 11
The Key to Above and Below. List ye, O man, hear ye my voice, teaching of Wisdom and Light in this cycle; teach ye the way to the Light. List ye now to the voice of Thoth. I am the bringer of the Light.

Tablet 12
The Law of Cause and Effect and The Key of Prophecy. Know ye, O man, that all that exists is in motion. Only in the change-less is there rest. In the change-less is the cause of all change. The Law of Cause and Effect is the key to all knowledge.

Tablet 13
The Keys of Life and Death. List ye, O man, hear ye my voice, teaching of Wisdom and Light in this cycle; teach ye the way to the Light. List ye now to the voice of Thoth. I am the bringer of the Light.

Tablet 14
Atlantis. In the days of the first man, before the flood, in the days of the first man, did the Great Ones come down from the stars. They came in ships of fire and light and taught the children of men the ways of the Light.

Tablet 15
The Secret of Secrets. Now I give thee the Secret of Secrets. Now I give thee the knowledge of the ages. Now I give thee the power of the ancients. Listen ye, O man, and be wise.
